  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oven to 450 F. Line a large rimmed sheet pan with parchment paper.",
    "Cut the potatoes into small pieces so they cook fast. Put them on the pan.",
    "Add the peppers and onion to the pan. Drizzle with the olive oil.",
    "Sprinkle with the oregano, garlic powder, salt, and pepper. Toss well and spread in a single layer.",
    "Roast for 10 minutes.",
    "Take the pan out and push the vegetables aside. Add the sausage pieces and stir everything together.",
    "Roast 12 to 13 minutes more, stirring once. The potatoes should be golden and tender, and the sausage should reach 160 F in the center.",
    "Let the pan rest for 3 minutes, then serve."
